### 2. View Template Rendering

**File:** `/c/Users/edn_y/renew_nineonelabs/views/pages/works/view.php` (lines 1-177)

**Key Points:**
- Single template for all detail view requests
- `?view=scatter` parameter is **re-constructed** only for the "back" link (lines 4-21)
- Template does not conditionally render based on view type
- All images use `render_uploaded_image()` helper (lines 126-131, 151)

**Content Structure:**
- Hero/thumbnail section (lines 121-132): thumbnail image or video
- Work metadata (lines 73-118): title, services, client, category, update date
- Overview section (lines 136-140)
- Contents section (lines 142-146)
- Detail images grid (lines 149-153)

